### 约定总览
GET http://localhost:8023/api/restful/overview

### 分页列表
GET http://localhost:8023/api/articles?pageNum=1&pageSize=10

### 关键字过滤
GET http://localhost:8023/api/articles?keyword=REST

### 查询单篇（把 id 换成实际值）
GET http://localhost:8023/api/articles/1001

### 创建 → 看 201 + Location
POST http://localhost:8023/api/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "新文章",
  "content": "REST 创建演示"
}

### 全量替换 PUT
PUT http://localhost:8023/api/articles/1001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "已发布标题",
  "content": "全量替换后的正文",
  "status": "PUBLISHED"
}

### 部分更新 PATCH
PATCH http://localhost:8023/api/articles/1001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "只改标题"
}

### 删除 → 204
DELETE http://localhost:8023/api/articles/1001

### 信封风格失败（HTTP 200 + code=404）
GET http://localhost:8023/api/restful/styles/envelope/999999

### HTTP 状态风格失败（HTTP 404 + code=404）
GET http://localhost:8023/api/restful/styles/status/999999
